{"nodes":[{"id":"center","type":"text","x":-190,"y":-105,"width":420,"height":220,"color":"6","text":"# Lancer\n🃏 Son of King and prince of the Card Kingdom; secondary antagonist of Ch.1, who becomes an ally and close friend of Susie."},{"id":"center-img","type":"file","x":-640,"y":-105,"width":220,"height":190,"file":"Sprites/Lancer_Overworld.webp"},{"id":"s0","type":"text","x":-130,"y":-640,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"1","text":"**Susie**\nHis best friend. They met as fake rivals/allies in Ch.1 and forged a genuine bond that stays strong chapter after chapter — she carries him piggyback, protects him, and he admires her."},{"id":"s0-img","type":"file","x":-130,"y":-870,"width":220,"height":180,"file":"Sprites/Susie_and_Lancer_overworld_high_five.gif"},{"id":"s1","type":"text","x":420,"y":-260,"width":280,"height":230,"color":"1","text":"**King**\nHis father — according to Seam, technically a co-ruler alongside him, though in practice he ignores him almost entirely. His threat to throw him off the roof turned out to be a bluff."},{"id":"s2","type":"text","x":420,"y":220,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"1","text":"**Queen**\nHis mother, though Queen herself admits their relationship was \"arbitrarily decided\" the day the topic came up — it's unclear whether there's any real biological kinship."},{"id":"s3","type":"text","x":-130,"y":480,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"1","text":"**Rouxls Kaard**\nHis \"minor father\" — who actually cares for and feeds him, despite pretending not to care."},{"id":"s4","type":"text","x":-680,"y":220,"width":280,"height":240,"color":"3","text":"**Why is Queen his mother?**\nQueen herself leaves the relationship deliberately ambiguous (\"arbitrarily decided\"), without clarifying whether there's real kinship or just a symbolic/adoptive bond."},{"id":"s5","type":"text","x":700,"y":-640,"width":300,"height":220,"color":"1","text":"**Original design (kanotynes, 2012)**\nHe was born as the Jack of Spades in a 52-card deck series, six years before Ch.1. Not even his own designer was sure what he was — she suggested he might be a Kewpie doll."},{"id":"s5-img","type":"file","x":700,"y":-870,"width":170,"height":190,"file":"Sprites/Lancer_face_joining.png"},{"id":"s6","type":"text","x":-800,"y":-450,"width":300,"height":210,"color":"1","text":"**LancerCon**\nHis controllers, used to play as Lancer in the TV World puzzles — needed to get the Ch.3 Egg."},{"id":"s6-img","type":"file","x":-800,"y":-660,"width":170,"height":150,"file":"Sprites/man_LancerCon_item_first_console.png"},{"id":"s1-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/King_face.png","x":420,"y":-470,"width":240,"height":180},{"id":"s2-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Queen_deltarune.webp","x":420,"y":10,"width":240,"height":180},{"id":"s3-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Rouxls_Kaard_face.png","x":-130,"y":270,"width":240,"height":180}],"edges":[{"id":"e0","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s0","toSide":"top","color":"1"},{"id":"e0_img","fromNode":"s0-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s0","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"e1","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s1","toSide":"right","color":"1"},{"id":"e2","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s2","toSide":"right","color":"1"},{"id":"e3","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"top","toNode":"s3","toSide":"bottom","color":"1"},{"id":"e4_x2","fromNode":"s4","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s2","toSide":"right","color":"1"},{"id":"e4","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s4","toSide":"left","color":"3"},{"id":"e5","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s5","toSide":"left","color":"1"},{"id":"e5_img","fromNode":"s5-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s5","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"e6","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s6","toSide":"right","color":"1"},{"id":"e6_img","fromNode":"s6-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s6","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"e_s1-img","fromNode":"s1-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s1","toSide":"top","color":"1"},{"id":"e_s2-img","fromNode":"s2-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s2","toSide":"top","color":"1"},{"id":"e_s3-img","fromNode":"s3-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s3","toSide":"top","color":"1"}]}